s://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-06-06T15:20:59Z","updated_at":"2019-06-08T05:11:17Z","closed_at":"2019-06-08T05:11:17Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The checkpoint is executed with the following order of commands:\r\n1) Disable .SST files deletion\r\n2) Take a list of DB live files (.SST + CURRENT + MANIFEST)\r\n3) Copy/hard link all necessary files.\r\n4) Enable .SST files deletion\r\n\r\nWhen compaction/flush finishes it writes new .SST file and adds it to MANIFEST.\r\nBut usually, it is just added to the end of MANIFEST.\r\nAnd it could happen in parallel to the checkpoint.\r\nSo manifest would reference a new file, that was not listed at step (2).\r\nSuch a checkpoint is incorrect and could not be opened as RocksDB.\r\n\r\nThis problem affects remote bootstrap and backups, that use RocksDB checkpoints.\r\nRemote bootstrap could fail to open the bootstrapped tablet, it is not critical, since we could always redo remote bootstrap.\r\nBackup based on such a checkpoint would not be possible to restore.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1491/r